#: ../../source/find-cache-dir_readme.md:46
msgid "findCacheDir([options])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/find-cache-dir_readme.md:48
msgid ""
"Finds the cache directory using the supplied options. The algorithm tries"
" to find a `package.json` file, searching every parent directory of the "
"`cwd` specified (or implied from other options). It returns a `string` "
"containing the absolute path to the cache directory, or `null` if "
"`package.json` was never found."
msgstr ""

